rm:linuxbsd","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-10-25T00:47:22Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T13:54:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.5\n\n### System information\n\nGodot 4.4, Godot 4.5\n\n### Issue description\n\nI just found this code in the wild while debugging a project over the CIFS and found that the feature that implements the support (calling 'realpath') causes a 0.3 second delay on each open.   In my case, I was testing a project with 294 files (mind you, they do not need to be real juicy ones, just a bunch of .txt files will do).\n\nI think that the feature is well intentioned, it was introduced in c09731c4137a28f2d3ba954a11e83fdc7b535ba8, but I think that it is a bad implementation of the idea.   It is implemented at the 'open' level, so every time you attempt to open a file, it is actually doing a lot of non-open related activities.   This probably went unnoticed until the more recent ResourceFormatLoader::get_resource_uid came into play to load the `.uid` files.\n\nThe activity is namely to call `realpath` on Unix, which triggers very expensive network operations in this case, and if it detects an anomaly it reports \"You are going to have trouble at some point\", not in the UI, but in the console.\n\nThis might be a useful flag to use when running a project in some lint mode, but it is certainly not a good idea to put in the `open` method.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen a project over a CIFS network on a Unix system.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe project needs to have a lot of files.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112020/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112020/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}